Hello everybody! You may be wondering if the Power Brain Trainer will be upgraded to version 5.0. Is not it? Are you expecting new chapters, new exercises, new tests, new features? In this post, we will try to briefly tell you about the situation with the next updates.

Every major update is not easy for us. At the heart of the first version 1.0, as well as updates to versions 2.0, 3.0, and the last major update 4.0 is a technological breakthrough. This is not just a number on the counter, but a large-scale change of the system, which makes the Power Brain Trainer better and better every time. Remember what the upgrade to version 4.0 was like. We can safely say that this version has changed the game, improving it dozens of times.

All major upgrades require a lot of effort and time from us. To have time to release updates at the specified time, our team works around the clock and without weekends. We have to set aside absolutely all our other activities, including recreation, so you can play a better Power Brain Trainer than before. Not everything turns out perfectly. We don't have enough time to do everything very well, but we try our best. It is for bug fixes and minor changes that we sometimes release small updates. But in parallel with small updates, we are always working on big ones. Despite the fact that such updates seem simple and unnecessary, we still invest our efforts in them and each time we fix some really significant problems in the game. And sometimes small updates also contain new interesting features.

We already have a plan for version 5.0. But whether the release will take place is up to you. Now we have planned some new sections, including a collection of classic games "Brain Games", as well as new exercises, a new category of exercises "Thinking", new opportunities for analysis, improved design and music, as well as improving reliability and quality. This time the work for us is even more than it was at 4.0. Can we handle this? Yes of course. The question is another: do we have support? Does anyone need it? Does it make sense for us to develop this program further? The Power Brain Trainer could really change the world in the future, make many improvements in brain training, individual development, and improve digital education. But now everything is based on your support.

You think you can't support us. In vain. There are many options that do not require much effort from you, and for us it will be a small impetus to continue working:
[list]
[*] you can react to this publication, evaluate with your finger up;
[*] if you have not yet purchased PBT, you can do so now;
[*] if you do not have the GOLD extension, you can purchase it;
[*] write a positive review, if desired;
[*] your friends may also be interested, recommend them to add to the wishlist;
[*] disseminate information about our program, if you have the opportunity.
[/list]

All these small steps in large numbers can be crucial to continue working on future versions. If you want to contact us, use this e-mail: brain.trainer.dev@gmail.com
